{"id":"ca4615f704459c6c","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-top3-compact-open-topology.md","title":"ZFC Top3 Compact Open Topology","display":"df-zfc-top3-compact-open-topology — ZFC Top3 Compact Open Topology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top3-compact-open-topology","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top3-compact-open-topology"],"display":"df-zfc-top3-compact-open-topology — ZFC Top3 Compact Open Topology","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-top3-compact-open-subbasis]]","[[58-df-zfc-top-subbase]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]","[[58-df-continuous-map]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top3-compact-open-topology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top3-compact-open-topology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top3-compact-open-topology — ZFC Top3 Compact Open Topology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4abdb0543c46f591\" href=\"?note=4abdb0543c46f591\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top3-compact-open-subbasis\">58-df-zfc-top3-compact-open-subbasis</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d6956c8a704f51c7\" href=\"?note=d6956c8a704f51c7\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top-subbase\">58-df-zfc-top-subbase</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"58-df-continuous-map\">58-df-continuous-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in V\">\\(X,Y\\in V\\)</span> (topological carriers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_X\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\tau_X\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_Y\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)\">\\(\\tau_Y\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)\\)</span> (topologies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in V\">\\(\\sigma\\in V\\)</span> 为紧开拓扑候选；连续映射载体由下式中同一对指定拓扑的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 确定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (compact-open subbasis witness)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C\\in V\\)</span> (continuous-map space witness)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopSubbase}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopSubbase}_S\\)</span> (subbase predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d6956c8a704f51c7\" href=\"?note=d6956c8a704f51c7\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top-subbase\">58-df-zfc-top-subbase</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3CompactOpenSubbasis}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop3CompactOpenSubbasis}_S\\)</span> (predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S,\\operatorname{Continuous}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S,\\operatorname{Continuous}_S\\)</span> (sourced topological predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3CompactOpenTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop3CompactOpenTopology}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top3\\text{-}compact\\text{-}open\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop3CompactOpenTopology}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\exists\\mathcal C,S\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathcal C=\\{f\\in\\mathcal P(X\\times Y):\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\operatorname{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop3CompactOpenSubbasis}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,S)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopSubbase}_S(S,\\mathcal C,\\sigma)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top3\\text{-}compact\\text{-}open\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop3CompactOpenTopology}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\exists\\mathcal C,S\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathcal C=\\{f\\in\\mathcal P(X\\times Y):\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\operatorname{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop3CompactOpenSubbasis}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,S)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopSubbase}_S(S,\\mathcal C,\\sigma)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier is the set of sourced continuous maps, and the compact-open family is required to be a subbase for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> on that carrier.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top3-compact-open-subbasis","status":"resolved","id":"4abdb054